msgid ""
"Presentamos una colección que redefine la moda deportiva fusionando la alta "
"costura con la más avanzada tecnología textil."
msgstr ""
"We present a collection that redefines sports fashion by merging haute "
"couture with the most advanced textile technology."

msgid "Nuestra esencia"
msgstr "Our essence"

msgid ""
"Fusionamos lujo deportivo con nanotecnología avanzada y bienestar integral, "
"creando una experiencia de usuario única y emocionalmente gratificante."
msgstr ""
"We merge sports luxury with advanced nanotechnology and holistic wellness, "
"creating a unique and emotionally rewarding user experience."

msgid "Beneficios Clave"
msgstr "Key Benefits"

msgid "Rendimiento Mejorado"
msgstr "Enhanced Performance"

msgid ""
"Optimiza tu desempeño con textiles avanzados que se adaptan a tu ritmo."
msgstr ""
"Optimize your performance with advanced textiles that adapt to your pace."

msgid "Protección UV"
msgstr "UV Protection"

msgid ""
"Cuida tu piel con nuestra tecnología antimicrobiana y protección solar "
"integrada."
msgstr ""
"Take care of your skin with our antimicrobial technology and integrated sun "
"protection."

msgid "Control Térmico"
msgstr "Thermal Control"

msgid "Mantente cómodo con materiales que regulan tu temperatura corporal."
msgstr "Stay comfortable with materials that regulate your body temperature."

msgid "Confort Personalizado "
msgstr "Personalized Comfort"

msgid "Texturas únicas que brindan una experiencia sensorial inigualable."
msgstr "Unique textures that provide an unparalleled sensory experience."

msgid "Nuestros clientes opinan"
msgstr "Our clients say"

msgid ""
"“Las prendas de GoToGym se convirtieron en mis favoritas. Al principio "
"parecían normales, pero con el tiempo noté la diferencia positiva en "
"rendimiento y comodidad. Ahora no puedo hacer ejercicio sin ellas.”"
msgstr ""
"GoToGym garments became my favorites. At first they seemed normal, but over "
"time I noticed the positive difference in performance and comfort. Now I "
"can't work out without them."

msgid "— Juan Manuel Goenaga"
msgstr "— Juan Manuel Goenaga"

msgid "Tecnología innovadora"
msgstr "Innovative technology"

msgid ""
"Utilizamos grafeno y nanotecnología en nuestras prendas, garantizando "
"resistencia, flexibilidad y un compromiso continuo con la sostenibilidad "
"ambiental."
msgstr ""
"We use graphene and nanotechnology in our garments, ensuring strength, "
"flexibility, and a continuous commitment to environmental sustainability."

